{
  "id": "E336",
  "title": "Iced Water or Cold Water",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-06-22",
  "synopsis": "Ben wants something cold to drink.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1077/ca351437cdf33230e83d6a41643618543e274609.mp3?1560418718",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "冰水还是冷水\n\n服务员：您好，要喝点什么？\n本：我要一杯气泡水，冷的。\n服务员：好的，稍等。\n（五分钟后）\n服务员：您好，您的气泡水。\n本：服务员，怎么没有冰？我要的是冷的。\n服务员：“冷的“就是室温的，没有冰。如果你想喝有冰的，你得说“冰的”。\n本：原来是这样啊。不好意思，我说错了。麻烦再给我来点冰块。",
    "traditional": "冰水還是冷水\n\n服務員：您好，要喝點什麼？\n本：我要一杯氣泡水，冷的。\n服務員：好的，稍等。\n（五分鐘後）\n服務員：您好，您的氣泡水。\n本：服務員，怎麼沒有冰？我要的是冷的。\n服務員：“冷的“就是室溫的，沒有冰。如果你想喝有冰的，你得說“冰的”。\n本：原來是這樣啊。不好意思，我說錯了。麻煩再給我來點冰塊。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Iced Water or Cold Water"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "服务员：您好，要喝点什么？",
      "traditional": "服務員：您好，要喝點什麼？",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán nín hǎo yào hē diǎn shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Hello, would you like something to drink?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：我要一杯气泡水，冷的。",
      "traditional": "本：我要一杯氣泡水，冷的。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ yào yì bēi qì pào shuǐ lěng de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I want a cup of sparkling water, cold."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "服务员：好的，稍等。",
      "traditional": "服務員：好的，稍等。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo de shāo děng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: OK, wait a moment."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "（五分钟后）",
      "traditional": "（五分鐘後）",
      "pinyin": "wǔ fēn zhōng hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(Five minutes later)"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "服务员：您好，您的气泡水。",
      "traditional": "服務員：您好，您的氣泡水。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán nín hǎo nín de qì pào shuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Hello, your sparkling water."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：服务员，怎么没有冰？我要的是冷的。",
      "traditional": "本：服務員，怎麼沒有冰？我要的是冷的。",
      "pinyin": "běn fú wù yuán zěn me méi yǒu bīng wǒ yào de shì lěng de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Waiter, why is there no ice? What I wanted was cold."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "服务员：“冷的“就是室温的，没有冰。如果你想喝有冰的，你得说“冰的”。",
      "traditional": "服務員：“冷的“就是室溫的，沒有冰。如果你想喝有冰的，你得說“冰的”。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán lěng de jiù shì shì wēn de méi yǒu bīng rú guǒ nǐ xiǎng hē yǒu bīng de nǐ děi shuō bīng de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: “Cold” is room temperature, without ice. If you want a drink that has ice, you have to say “iced”."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：原来是这样啊。不好意思，我说错了。",
      "traditional": "本：原來是這樣啊。不好意思，我說錯了。",
      "pinyin": "běn yuán lái shì zhè yàng a bù hǎo yì si wǒ shuō cuò le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "麻烦再给我来点冰块。",
      "traditional": "麻煩再給我來點冰塊。",
      "pinyin": "má fan zài gěi wǒ lái diǎn bīng kuài",
      "english": "Ben: So that’s how it is. I’m sorry, I said it wrong."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Can I trouble you again to give me some ice cubes?"
    }
  ],
